{"id":"cc9bc888c7dda430","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-first-order-language.md","title":"First-Order Language","display":"df-first-order-language — First-Order Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-first-order-language","aliases":["93-df-first-order-language"],"display":"df-first-order-language — First-Order Language","depends_on":["[[93-df-similarity-type]]","[[93-df-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-first-order-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-first-order-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-language — First-Order Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11b62d0ad578fa42\" href=\"?note=11b62d0ad578fa42\" title=\"93-df-variable\">93-df-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span> is the fixed countably infinite variable set.</li>\n<li>A first-order language separates function symbols <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> from relation symbols <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> and supplies arity maps <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_F:F\\to\\omega\">\\(\\alpha_F:F\\to\\omega\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_R:R\\to\\omega\">\\(\\alpha_R:R\\to\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span> is the sourced arity-signature predicate.</li>\n<li>The five tags <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathtt{eq},\\mathtt{rel},\\mathtt{neg},\\mathtt{and},\\mathtt{all}\">\\(\\mathtt{eq},\\mathtt{rel},\\mathtt{neg},\\mathtt{and},\\mathtt{all}\\)</span>, together with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sym}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sym}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LogTag}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{LogTag}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOSubLang}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOSubLang}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOCompat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOCompat}_{93}\\)</span>, are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathtt{eq}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle 0,0\\rangle,&amp;\n\\mathtt{rel}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle 0,1\\rangle,&amp;\n\\mathtt{neg}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle 0,2\\rangle,&amp;\n\\mathtt{and}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle 0,3\\rangle,&amp;\n\\mathtt{all}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle 0,4\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{LogTag}_{93}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathtt{eq},\\mathtt{rel},\\mathtt{neg},\\mathtt{and},\\mathtt{all}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathtt{eq}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle 0,0\\rangle,&amp;\n\\mathtt{rel}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle 0,1\\rangle,&amp;\n\\mathtt{neg}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle 0,2\\rangle,&amp;\n\\mathtt{and}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle 0,3\\rangle,&amp;\n\\mathtt{all}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle 0,4\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{LogTag}_{93}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathtt{eq},\\mathtt{rel},\\mathtt{neg},\\mathtt{and},\\mathtt{all}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\langle F,R,\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R,X\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq F,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\langle F,R,\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R,X\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq R,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\langle F,R,\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R,X\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha_F,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\langle F,R,\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R,X\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha_R,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sym}_{93}(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\langle F,R,\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R,X\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq F,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\langle F,R,\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R,X\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq R,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\langle F,R,\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R,X\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha_F,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\langle F,R,\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R,X\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha_R,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sym}_{93}(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\exists F,R,\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\mathcal L=\\langle F,R,\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(F,\\alpha_F)\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(R,\\alpha_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land F\\cap R=\\varnothing\n\\land(F\\cup R\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\cap\\operatorname{LogTag}_{93}=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land(F\\cup R)\\cap\\mathrm{Var}_{93}=\\varnothing\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\exists F,R,\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\mathcal L=\\langle F,R,\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(F,\\alpha_F)\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(R,\\alpha_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land F\\cap R=\\varnothing\n\\land(F\\cup R\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\cap\\operatorname{LogTag}_{93}=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land(F\\cup R)\\cap\\mathrm{Var}_{93}=\\varnothing\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOSubLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\\land\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\n\\land\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)=\n\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)=\n\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOSubLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\\land\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\n\\land\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)=\n\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)=\n\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOSubLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)\\land R\\notin\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)=\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\n\\land\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)=\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\\cup\\{R\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOSubLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)\\land R\\notin\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)=\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\n\\land\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)=\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\\cup\\{R\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOCompat}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1,\\mathcal L_2,\\mathcal L_{12})\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOSubLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1)\\land\\mathrm{FOSubLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{FOSubLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1,\\mathcal L_{12})\\land\\mathrm{FOSubLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_2,\\mathcal L_{12})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)=\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\\cap\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)=\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\\cap\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_{12})=\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\\cup\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_{12})=\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\\cup\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_2).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOCompat}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1,\\mathcal L_2,\\mathcal L_{12})\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOSubLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1)\\land\\mathrm{FOSubLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{FOSubLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1,\\mathcal L_{12})\\land\\mathrm{FOSubLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_2,\\mathcal L_{12})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)=\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\\cap\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)=\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\\cap\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_{12})=\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\\cup\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_{12})=\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\\cup\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_2).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This language object is deliberately distinct from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a33dcee0f62c9026\" href=\"?note=a33dcee0f62c9026\" title=\"93-df-language\">93-df-language</a>, whose sole symbol set is an algebraic or propositional similarity type. Relation symbols are not operations returning truth values.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"11b62d0ad578fa42","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"a33dcee0f62c9026","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"This language object is deliberately distinct fro